#showas:简单内战
A simple, if slightly crazy scenario. It's just you and two AIs, and both are set to difficulty 6.
This difficulty is good for someone who is a bit more experienced at AI War 2.

This is on the "simple" map type, with 80 planets. Full Ensemble AI type in both cases.
Your starting fleet is set to "Classic," which has the most basic available options.

Human Resistance Fighters are allies that will occasionally appear in a battle to help you for free, then leave after.

The main feature here is the AI Civil War! Both AIs will attack each other across the galaxy, from the moment the game starts. This can be pretty hectic, so you have some allies to help out.

This is more of a fun scenario, rather than something serious.